                                                        "sanitizedJobDescription": "\u003Cdiv>\n \u003Ch2 class=\"jobSectionHeader\">\u003Cb>Frontend Staff Software Engineer \u003C\u002Fb>\u003C\u002Fh2>A rapidly growing AI-driven SaaS company is looking for an experienced \u003Cb>Frontend Staff Software Engineer\u003C\u002Fb> to take a strategic and hands-on role in shaping the technical direction of their customer-facing product suite. This role plays a critical part in driving architectural decisions, mentoring team members, and enhancing the performance and reliability of the frontend ecosystem. \n \u003Ch2 class=\"jobSectionHeader\">\u003Cb>Job Description - Frontend Staff Software Engineer \u003C\u002Fb>\u003C\u002Fh2>Join a company revolutionizing the contact center space by combining natural language processing and machine learning to deliver automated, conversational customer service across multiple channels.\n \u003Cp>You will join a high-performing engineering team focused on developing scalable and intelligent user interfaces. This role plays a critical part in driving architectural decisions, mentoring team members, and enhancing the performance and reliability of the frontend ecosystem.\u003C\u002Fp>\n \u003Cp>\u003Cb> Key Responsibilities\u003C\u002Fb>\u003C\u002Fp>\n \u003Cul>\n  \u003Cli>Define and lead the technical roadmap within your domain.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Influence high-level architectural decisions and ensure alignment with broader engineering goals.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Initiate and drive improvements in scalability, performance, and developer experience.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Promote a culture of continuous learning, quality, and innovation across teams.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Identify technical gaps and propose solutions to enhance frontend capabilities.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Advocate for engineering best practices including accessibility, testing, and observability.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Collaborate cross-functionally with product, design, and backend teams to deliver seamless solutions.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Track and improve Service Level Objectives (SLOs) to maintain high standards of system reliability.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Mentor junior and mid-level engineers, fostering a collaborative and growth-oriented environment.\u003C\u002Fli>\n \u003C\u002Ful>\n \u003Ch2 class=\"jobSectionHeader\">\u003Cb>Requirements - Frontend Staff Software Engineer \u003C\u002Fb>\u003C\u002Fh2>\n \u003Cul>\n  \u003Cli>Experience as a Staff Software Engineer (or related role), ideally with 4+ years in a senior technical leadership role.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Demonstrated ownership of projects that span teams or domains.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Deep expertise in modern frontend technologies such as React, Next.js, and TypeScript.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Strong understanding of architectural principles for building scalable and maintainable applications.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Proficiency in HTML, SCSS, and a strong commitment to accessibility and design standards.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Experience with API integration (REST, GraphQL) and building intuitive data flows.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Skilled in frontend testing tools and methodologies (Playwright, Cypress, Jest, etc.).\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Adept at leveraging product analytics to generate actionable insights.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Comfortable working in agile, high-growth environments with strong collaboration skills.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Passion for mentoring, knowledge sharing, and building a thriving engineering culture.\u003C\u002Fli>\n \u003C\u002Ful>\n \u003Ch2 class=\"jobSectionHeader\">\u003Cb>The offer - Frontend Staff Software Engineer \u003C\u002Fb>\u003C\u002Fh2>\n \u003Cul>\n  \u003Cli>Join a diverse, international team with a strong engineering culture.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>The opportunity to shape a product with global impact at the forefront of AI and automation.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>A base salary of 130-170K plus equity package.\u003C\u002Fli>\n  \u003Cli>Flexible hybrid working model with a modern office in Berlin.\u003C\u002Fli>\n \u003C\u002Ful>\n\u003C\u002Fdiv> \u003Cbr> €150000",
