                                                                        <h2 class="jobSectionHeader">
                                                                            <b>Frontend Staff Software Engineer </b>
                                                                        </h2>
                                                                        A rapidly growing AI-driven SaaS company is looking for an experienced 
                                                                        <b>Frontend Staff Software Engineer</b>
